@ 34.4 - Proto-Quechumaran to Huarás
# citation: Pogostick Man, from Orr, Carolyn, and Robert E. Longacre (1968), “Proto-Quechumaran”.
# 			Language 44(3):528 – 555
	pʼ tʼ t͡ʃʼ kʼ qʼ > p t t͡s k q
	h > ∅ / p_
	tʰ > t
	q > q͡χ
	t͡s(h) t͡ʃ > t͡ʃ t͡s
	t͡ʃ > t͡s / _q
	ʈʂ > s / _[+ cons, - fr, + bk, + hi, - lo]
	ʈʂ > t͡ʃ / _V
	ɸ(ʼ,ʰ) > p
	ʂ > ʃ / _a
	ʂ > h / _{i,u}
	ɲ > n
	aw aj {uj,ij} > u:[+ long] e:[+ long] i:[+ long]